# Configure host without credentials in this versioned example.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@batchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Pilot preview: replace 7 with one existing local album ID.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/music/album-artist-backfills/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"albumIds": [7], "limit": 1}

### Alternative: preview up to five eligible legacy albums, without applying.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/music/album-artist-backfills/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"limit": 5}

### 2. Recover recent batch IDs, including interrupted requests.
GET {{host}}/api/admin/music/album-artist-backfills

### 3. Review before/proposed/provider; set batchId from the preview response.
GET {{host}}/api/admin/music/album-artist-backfills/{{batchId}}

### 4. Confirm the reviewed proposals. Repeating resumes write errors, skips successes.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/music/album-artist-backfills/{{batchId}}/apply

### 5. Optional undo: succeeds only if the album has not been edited since application.
POST {{host}}/api/admin/music/album-artist-backfills/{{batchId}}/undo
